                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/one-direction-gotta-be-you-og-2011-version-other-singles.306823/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					Hey folks -- been trying to grab a lossless version of the original "Gotta Be You." All I keep coming across is the weird 2012 U.S. Version (the one where Liam overemphasizes the word "<i>in</i>nocence").<br>
<br>
Can anyone help?<br>
<br>
Also, if anyone has any of the lossless singles originally shared in <a href="https://sharemania.us/threads/one-direction-complete-discography-flac-hi-res-flac-16bit-scans-hossein-enr7que.137987/" class="internalLink"><b>this thread</b></a> by <a href="https://sharemania.us/members/13364/" class="username" data-user="13364, @HosseinXO">@HosseinXO</a>, I'd really appreciate those, too -- but the OG "Gotta Be You" take is the most important one I'm seeking. I'll post clips of both versions below to assist.<br>
<br>
<div style="text-align: center"><span style="text-decoration: underline"><b>Original 2011 Version (the one I'm after): </b></span><br>
<br>
